E5 prototype for fuddlesworth/pokebw2 at 41f42ca1afe6291f00b0ba0ec3f6099b9ff1346c, so that a species can be inserted
after Genesect. (1) Every number in the engine and the packers that follows from the species count (the national
Pokédex's bounds, the sprite, icon and cry slots after the species, the musical's and Join Avenue's egg) comes from
the constants of generated/species.txt. (2) pokemon_graphics.py and pokemon_cries.py edit the extracted archives file
by file and can't add files, so an added species first gets a copy of its template species' files (its template.txt
names the template), which its own sources then edit. With the stock list nothing changes: every matching check passes
with Black 2's SHA1. Modifies GPL-3.0 code, so this patch is GPL-3.0. Recorded for Phase 1
(docs/research/e5-species.md); no build applies it. A species' own data, and its entry in sPokeIconPalettes, are
content, not part of this patch.
Check: git apply --check docs/research/e5-species-expansion.patch (in a pokebw2 checkout at the commit above).

